<title>USA: Children's Wonderland says delisted.</title>
<headline>Children's Wonderland says delisted.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Children's Wonderland Inc said Tuesday its stock has been delisted from the Nasdaq Stock Market effective today because it was unable to comply with the exchange's capital and surplus requirement.</p>
<p>The company, now trading on the OTC Bulletin Board under the symbol CWIC. said it is considering appealing the delisting.</p>
<p>Children's Wonderland said it has retained the Los Angeles investment banking firm Ambient Capital Group Inc to explore financing and strategic alliance options for the company.</p>
<p>((- New York Newsdesk, 212 859-1610))</p>
